            <div xml:id="m-60b9f12c-1c3a-4308-bcb3-78ca5b14fd19">
              <lg xml:id="m-3e223608-166c-4d6e-b31b-626827e1a5f5">
                <l xml:id="m-968ab919-fb32-4445-b072-41940332be40" facs="#m-7e02118d-bf89-4376-98fd-6ba5790ade75" label="text-like">At Matins (2nd Nocturn)</l><l xml:id="m-5e7eae22-c3c7-4d9b-b869-77981ae1a490" facs="#m-b539710f-3ec9-4516-98f6-41a7102e85f7" label="ambiguous">703</l><l xml:id="m-73bee05f-4e3e-4dd6-b6db-52a278d5ceb1" facs="#m-d30c3189-00b4-4e04-9238-ac173e94b887" label="ambiguous">tis</l><l xml:id="m-f9b0c4e4-4aea-45bb-aefc-09de3280fea6" facs="#m-16725e64-5d62-4d95-994c-ac527d037b8b" label="ambiguous">ad cru-ci¬ fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-10238e96-2517-4c8e-89ff-906d74c405f4" facs="#m-10352735-b787-4b79-922f-2798bf80b4a6" label="lyrics-like">gén- dum. V. Cumque</l><l xml:id="m-772de21a-bccc-437f-8df5-d79f2d8e2176" facs="#m-b1407609-3f1f-4631-9c76-b2f364c11e92" label="lyrics-like">inje-císsent mánus in Jésum, et te-nu-issent é¬ um,</l><l xml:id="m-f63ae0e4-1eb6-431e-b882-f9c6b630e72c" facs="#m-147e7a67-c72b-48cb-b414-15a1fbe16309" label="lyrics-like">"Quo-tí-di-e.</l><l xml:id="m-b994db89-f8cb-4291-9bac-877f619f739e" facs="#m-41ac8bcd-a6a3-4bc3-b4b1-3d495649ac43" label="lyrics-like">dí- xit ad é¬</l><l xml:id="m-2afcca63-f77f-40ad-88ed-181406dd9661" facs="#m-6c9ea756-fc51-44b9-9ac7-c478b8b7324c" label="ambiguous">os.</l><l xml:id="m-07c2692c-4f88-4f33-b6c0-2e8e69ba1556" facs="#m-4b3d8426-b9f8-4b00-be42-e3665a6527b8" label="ambiguous">LESSON V</l><l xml:id="m-22a0f5ec-ea92-4387-b0aa-3216eae07d7f" facs="#m-0c98767e-5a9a-48a2-a376-d6d646844026" label="lyrics-like">pOstis qui convéntus erat ma-[multa febre phrenétici, insa¬</l><l xml:id="m-9570cabd-45bf-4c13-b348-33e9ad5789c5" facs="#m-2f053db0-683f-4cbd-bfb2-8cff8f54fb30" label="lyrics-like">1t lignántium Judacórum, et</l><l xml:id="m-357f7e08-1371-475d-821d-371539c95a77" facs="#m-bab45880-7cf0-47e0-8b01-d62f461c9113" label="lyrics-like">niéntes in médicum qui vénerat</l><l xml:id="m-8434c74d-a779-470b-bcd4-2b52a809a446" facs="#m-0fd855f2-78d0-4f95-ba11-c9f786e8e962" label="lyrics-like">curáre eos, excogitavérunt con¬</l><l xml:id="m-98b444f6-4a81-4578-9abf-deaee9d91138" facs="#m-8842a7b6-58a0-4173-9619-28cf5f19990d" label="lyrics-like">quae multitúdo erat operántium</l><l xml:id="m-029afced-6fc3-4a39-b970-1ae241687bf2" facs="#m-dcecc556-fb01-4234-963d-7c2c488ed7b3" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátem. Quam iniquitátem?</l><l xml:id="m-032719a0-56be-4cd2-8b9c-fab0c8ffc6da" facs="#m-c6241f44-2106-4869-ae8b-bcbd7adf3138" label="lyrics-like">sstium perdéndi eum: tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-cbdbfdb6-5cd4-401a-abe1-ee30a8f2d541" facs="#m-f2c092c3-bf90-4494-ad02-52404299f561" label="lyrics-like">Quia voluérunt occidere Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e502bdc-f6d8-4a68-a685-6f1c02828040" facs="#m-7f58eebc-d610-4770-80c2-7977a5e2f119" label="lyrics-like">ibi voléntes probáre, utrum vere</l><l xml:id="m-0d9b2bd6-d7ed-4038-82c0-988e3f6f8102" facs="#m-223eeca4-c3b4-43bd-97cb-fa2a19f3fb70" label="ambiguous">num Jesum Christum. Tanta</l><l xml:id="m-13e16de9-098e-4027-905b-2d0095e82baa" facs="#m-981fefb0-9679-46ad-a1fe-4e5e55425c5a" label="ambiguous">homo sit, qui mori possit, an</l><l xml:id="m-2408f5b9-c000-4647-9786-af5b3135e7f6" facs="#m-51a00d1c-2e86-478f-8456-84caba755998" label="lyrics-like">áliquid super hómines sit, et</l><l xml:id="m-8de52e47-803a-4bfd-b925-2c3fae1479ef" facs="#m-ec12ed1b-4ce0-4bfd-8d06-001f4c03f1a9" label="lyrics-like">ópera bona, inquit, osténdi vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc04eb4e-e386-49c5-99dd-d40511c59440" facs="#m-76ff8243-42de-4790-844c-ae736697454d" label="ambiguous">bis: propter quod horum me</l><l xml:id="m-926a4fd2-76f1-4f0b-ab6c-a6c547f125ae" facs="#m-e93f0c12-1f3b-49fa-a218-c6b3bdfc0cae" label="ambiguous">mori se non permittat. Verbum</l><l xml:id="m-d2376d20-952f-4981-aaf2-df8ca98c2a38" facs="#m-dba8290a-d856-4ab9-a846-4289ad5989d8" label="lyrics-like">vultis occidere? Pértulit omnes</l><l xml:id="m-d58a3a2e-5f89-4fda-a83d-bfd6cfaa131e" facs="#m-e7b6da9a-43b4-4397-b49a-e6c8b41cce45" label="lyrics-like">ipsórum agnóscimus in Sapiéntia</l><l xml:id="m-e1630b68-25fb-4a48-b1db-f78987dbea63" facs="#m-b1a7a07f-d414-4cd2-abe8-260d70e6f689" label="lyrics-like">infirmos eórum, curávit omnes</l><l xml:id="m-b2de6e54-fcb7-4f1f-9420-b0512aa542a7" facs="#m-1cd1cb6d-e55c-44e4-a19f-9e51a3c17773" label="lyrics-like">Salomónis: Morte turpíssima,</l><l xml:id="m-b3f414d7-094a-42f7-a28b-ffa8272c0aea" facs="#m-488f5a89-326a-4a05-aa6b-036609fb83b9" label="lyrics-like">lánguidos eórum, praedicávit re¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c9c1d14-dba9-45c4-bbb3-868d900e799b" facs="#m-5a79c578-d098-4200-8646-71372a7faf32" label="lyrics-like">inquiunt, condemnémus eum.</l><l xml:id="m-729c5729-ca4e-4e72-8eb8-fb8a577294e5" facs="#m-167ca1f9-f690-4eff-a86c-df48e75a02ef" label="lyrics-like">gnum caelórum, non tácuit vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9156b605-5ee2-48e9-9693-89b9a091b2f3" facs="#m-c25147f1-6e98-4d83-bdc1-13f692cb8d18" label="lyrics-like">Interrogémus eum: erit enim</l><l xml:id="m-dec39e92-7d1f-40dc-a630-7d5bc5cc4174" facs="#m-460133aa-f779-418c-a5fb-eb87c52c3db3" label="lyrics-like">tia córum, ut ipsa pótius eis dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9c74a12-a017-4107-9065-9b77a384bdc0" facs="#m-656e1a9c-bd24-429a-9b8b-ebb0bb6e6637" label="lyrics-like">respéctus in sermónibus illus.</l><l xml:id="m-274c1afe-ed0b-4c4d-b46f-8b6db4d59286" facs="#m-de1dab25-e493-41cd-9df1-bbb914b95935" label="ambiguous">si enim vere Filius Dei est,</l><l xml:id="m-7dad8360-fe77-4b11-8090-596292435586" facs="#m-34acc56d-3ff1-4673-b161-72117c22cb7c" label="lyrics-like">plicérent, non médicus, a quo</l><l xml:id="m-a5d13c9a-305f-4935-8bf4-0eb4f44cb0e5" facs="#m-7a15e416-265e-4a9e-9578-df4e29edce18" label="lyrics-like">sanabántur. His ómnibus cura¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f463f98-f06e-43c5-9714-7e2c43c67999" facs="#m-f52a88cf-1bd2-4c02-9f0f-b5ea25985048" label="ambiguous">uberet eum.</l><l xml:id="m-6fdd44d8-ff62-438f-9df8-3098e83864ca" facs="#m-90f90044-eca8-4248-96f9-543c03301838" label="lyrics-like">tiónibus ejus ingráti, tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-529bf935-ef67-4b5a-b4bc-7c840c446b6a" facs="#m-58236310-6c60-46c9-bdd7-9d9af12961fa" label="ambiguous">nesp.5</l><l xml:id="m-e6d1095e-3b05-4670-920d-0bfefba69793" facs="#m-e89cbc31-f2b2-4e1e-bc87-cfeedde971ee" label="lyrics-like">AEnebrae“ fáctae sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-9b5ef217-c9fa-4356-bfc1-8c25caf8b7e2" facs="#m-cfafb48a-bf6b-4298-b29e-a7183a38d1ee" label="lyrics-like">dum cruci-fi-xíssent Jé¬</l><l xml:id="m-87b83201-a798-4e19-a6b0-759d30113a3d" facs="#m-db36688e-0f13-40ec-936f-eda746247f29" label="lyrics-like">sum Ju¬ daé¬ i: et cir-ca hó-ram nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-14dceb2d-969e-4105-9075-4f49f4a036b7" facs="#m-5746231a-5fec-4537-be33-c108d5a74dd4" label="ambiguous">nam</l><l xml:id="m-6dfce4ee-6908-4040-b83f-e4bb446d128d" facs="#m-4c9eda84-6df2-40e6-ba04-e4c5419064de" label="lyrics-like">Jé¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f55abc4-e9ea-45ae-a5f9-d7b455799b66" facs="#m-a8c5d439-ef58-4589-ac6f-12d97bd7a515" label="lyrics-like">excla- má-vit</l><l xml:id="m-1be51cf9-3269-4a31-a6e0-cccb95d9594b" facs="#m-cd6cc9c9-efbf-4268-85aa-b94e18fc7fc1" label="lyrics-like">sus vó¬ ce</l><l xml:id="m-1d98b6e5-085c-41a5-80c7-c5b802c5c94a" facs="#m-9467e999-9d84-47e6-911f-5ce6e8279039" label="lyrics-like">má- gna:</l></lg>
